#==============================================================================================
#
#   abstract_operations - HTML's cross-origin objects: the abstract operations of Location and
#   Window objects accessed across origins, and access reporting
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/CrossOrigin/AbstractOperations.cpp (lines 1-263) and
#       Reporting.cpp (lines 1-93). The operations on JS property keys, property descriptors
#       and functions ([[GetOwnProperty]], Call, NativeFunction::create, well-known symbols)
#       need JavaScript objects, which exist with luce-js (phase 3); until then those bodies
#       trap and say so. CrossOriginProperties is plain data and is ported.
